Step 1: Update inline styles
Update the awards page inline CSS: - #2d3748 → #1a1a2e - #4a5568 → #4a4a5a - #4299e1 → #2563eb - Remove gradient text styles - Award images: keep border-radius and shadow, consistent with design
Step 2: Render and verify
